"开启后，有截止日期的待办会同步到所选提醒事项清单，并可在系统日历中显示。请在 Mac 和 iPhone 登录同一 Apple 账户，选择 iCloud 清单，并开启 iCloud「提醒事项」同步和通知权限。日历展示需 macOS 15／iOS 18 或更新版本。\n\n修改、完成和删除会同步，手机勾选或取消完成也会回传。图片、视频及其他附件不同步，子任务独立显示。紧急优先级不会自动开启系统紧急闹钟。关闭同步会保留已有提醒事项。" = "Sync dated tasks to the selected Reminders list and view them in Calendar. Use the same Apple Account on Mac and iPhone, select an iCloud list, and enable iCloud Reminders and notifications. Calendar display requires macOS 15 / iOS 18 or later.\n\nEdits, completion and deletion sync out; checking or unchecking on your phone syncs back. Attachments are not synced; subtasks appear separately. High priority does not enable an urgent alarm. Turning sync off keeps existing reminders.";

"系统侧已完成此父任务，还有 %1$@ 条未完成子任务。" = "The system completed this parent; %1$@ subtasks remain unfinished.";

"此条待办已停止同步。" = "Sync is paused for this task.";

"恢复此条同步" = "Resume this task";
